# Kor, Cause of Vengeance, "Whenever you attack, you may sacrifice another creature. If you do, draw a card, then
# Klingons and Warriors you control get +2/+2 until end of turn." (CR 603.4, 608.2c-d, 701.21a): Bot1 sacrifices its
# Grizzly Bears, so it draws a card and every Klingon and Warrior it controls - Kor itself (a Klingon Warrior) and the
# Burnout Bashtronaut (a Goblin Warrior) - gets +2/+2. Bot2's own Klingon Warrior is not Bot1's to pump.

[Bot1 Deck]
Kor, Cause of Vengeance
Burnout Bashtronaut
Grizzly Bears
Black Lotus x4
Black Lotus x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Gagh Slinger
Black Lotus
Island x18

